# Alembic Versions Directory

This directory contains all database migration files generated by Alembic.

## Migration File Naming

Files are named: `YYYYMMDD_HHMM_revision_description.py`

## Usage

- Generate new migration: `alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"`
- Apply migrations: `alembic upgrade head`
- Rollback: `alembic downgrade -1`
- View history: `alembic history`
